@startuml 10-ml-pipeline
' DOC-07 §7.11 — Offline ML pipeline (training → evaluation → publication). MLR-01..MLR-08.
title ML pipeline — from raw data to a published model version

|Data|
start
:Collect sources\n• KazSAnDRA (kk reviews, CC BY 4.0)\n• CEDR (ru emotions)\n• Own public sample (kk / ru / mixed);
:Anonymise\n(names, phones, IIN, e-mails);
:Normalise & tag language\n(NFC, keep ә ғ қ ң ө ұ ү һ і;\nkk / ru / mixed);
:Deduplicate\n(char n-gram cosine > 0.95);
|Annotation|
:Annotate with 6 emotions\n(guidelines.md);
:Double-annotate ≥ 15 %\n→ Cohen's κ;
if (κ ≥ 0.60 ?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Revise guidelines,\nre-annotate disputed items;
  note right: loop back until\nagreement is acceptable
endif
:Map CEDR labels\n(no emotion → neutral);
:Stratified split 70 / 15 / 15\n(label × language slice);
|Training|
fork
  :TF-IDF char n-grams\n+ LogReg;
fork again
  :mBERT\nfine-tune;
fork again
  :XLM-R-base\nfine-tune (primary);
fork again
  :mDeBERTa-v3\nfine-tune;
end fork
:Off-the-shelf / reference baselines\n(RuBERT-tiny2-CEDR on ru slice,\nLLM zero-shot on sample);
|Evaluation|
:Per-slice report\nMacro-F1, P, R, confusion matrices\n(kk, ru, mixed, informal, overall);
:Paired bootstrap\nvs. TF-IDF baseline;
if (MLR-06 met on every slice?) then (yes)
  |Publication|
  :Export model + tokenizer + label map\n(+ optional ONNX);
  :Write model card;
  :Register model_version\n(version, metrics) in DB;
  :Copy to model store volume;\nrestart ml-service;
  stop
else (no)
  |Training|
  :Error analysis →\nadjust data / hyper-parameters;
  note right: new experiment config,\nnew DIP task
  stop
endif
@enduml
